          <b>PONDUGULA</b>
        </div>
        <div class="loader-line"><span></span></div>
        <div class="loader-tag">MAKEUP ARTIST · BRIDAL · EDITORIAL · GLAM</div>
        <div class="loader-status"><i></i> OPEN FOR HIRE · AVAILABLE FOR FREELANCE</div>
      </div>
